  "hypotheses": [
    "An exact retained 256-byte conventional PCI configuration image can be deterministically replayed into structural role and PCIe FLR capability facts without using class code as a Header Type substitute.",
    "PCIe Function Level Reset capability must come from capability ID 0x10 Device Capabilities dword bit 28 and a selected PCI_FLR reset method must bind the exact same retained capture and provider fact; copying an unrelated provider evidence hash must fail.",
    "DeviceRecord V3 and inventory verifier algorithm V2 can reject legacy records, provider observations outside captureStartedAt..capturedAt, forged provider digests, caller-selected HostSnapshot semantic digests, malformed capability chains, and cross-capture reset facts.",
    "Every generic publication provider must cover at least one DeviceRecord, while the union of PCI-specific fact bindings must remain an exact bijection with the published DeviceRecord set; these cross-field rules still require a product verifier.",
    "Evidence-only raw bytes and consistently rotated provider fact IDs may leave the semantic no-change projection stable, while Header Type or FLR semantic changes must advance the device, host topology, and no-change digest chain.",
    "A caller cannot turn factory-derived hardware, technical, admin, or complete-owner-group NO into YES before capability evaluation, and UNKNOWN or CONFLICT reset state must remain fail closed.",
    "A retained guest resource plan can be bounded and exactly schema/hash/upstream-bound without claiming that this component discovered BAR demand or ran the MMIO/BAR/RMRR/IRQ solver.",
    "An eligible component decision must carry all component premise boundaries, exact blockers, and productAuthorized=false into the operation-admission binding so serialization cannot launder it into product authority."
  ],
